{"body":"Slice T46, canonical `records`, Local table, M6.P2, actual parent #1415. Governing plan docs/reviews/plan-for-the-plan.md §§5–8; order D-WORKFLOW-188. D-WORKFLOW-236 binds the dated source contract. Root owns scope, criteria, dispatch and acceptance.\n\nCurrent: candidate brief docs/reviews/briefs/records.md v1 is being published for unfamiliar-executor proof. No A–D starts until the explicit dispatch names the proved version, clean execution seed and worktree. T44 completion is verified6592382782. T46 is last in the source-reading order; ordered integration remains separate.\n\n## Scope\n\nSource d707c82ab8c48b674acc1f95a9571f0cb24d226a, root tree b3ce6c6ea70d9d40ff2b74fff691a0a11f70e437. Exact records roots from areas.json, unchanged historical survey126149 rows/22984582 stored lines; generated15392661 CODE lines are not a reading budget. Current metadata127469 paths/2190843187 logical bytes, ten roots, 799/0/4 delta from92e8. No disk-savings or cleanup claim.\n\nFinite ten-entrypoint extraction:95 literal records occurrences/89 targets (86 day logs, next handoff, inventory and retros directory); original ambiguous/template/suppressed context remains separate. Read precise ranges defined in the brief, not all historical record bodies. All48 accepted T39 corrections are pre-correction identities in this coordinator snapshot; #686/#807/#346 own integration, accepted work is not reopened. #1407 retains monthly indexing and33-reference review. No lane-branch union.\n\nExecution owner after proof: T3 wN:p6 in fresh feature/m6-records-693 at /workspace/repos/pixelelated/distribution.worktrees/m6-records-693. A–D continuous, clean published D stop for root stream disposition. Current records only; no source fix, historical rewrite, removal/relocation, accepted producer replay or runtime.\n\nreviewed-at:\nexecution-seed:\nfixed-at:\n\nCan this be done on the VM? Immutable documentary/metadata analysis and new host record-check validation need no runtime. No build